Anyone who has ever organized an event knows the feeling. That low grade hum of anxiety that comes from juggling a dozen logistical threads, praying none of them unravel. The technical setup, sound, screens, lighting, is often the most stressful part of the whole job.

Running Malaga Event Gear in Malaga, Spain, taught me that the company was never really in the business of renting out speakers and screens. Looking back at our own packages, our own reviews and our own decisions, here is what building this business taught me about smart, customer centric business design.

